<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><img alt="VIP Banner" src="" style="max-width: 1640.6499999999999px" title="VIP Banner" /><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Hi </span><span style="color:black">{{{Recipient.FirstName}}}</span><span style="color:black">,</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">We are excited to welcome you on board {{{Case.Flight_Number_With_Code__c}}}&nbsp;from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}}<span style="color:red">&nbsp;</span>to&nbsp;{{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}<span style="color:red">&nbsp;</span><span style="color:black">on&nbsp;</span><span style="background:white"><span style="color:#242424">{{{Case.TECH_Departure_Date__c}}}.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">As you are a valued </span>{{{Recipient.Frequent_Flyer_Tier__c}}} <span style="color:black">member, </span><span style="color:black">our team is dedicated to overseeing your travel experiences with Qantas</span><span style="color:#222222"> and we’ve </span><span style="color:black">been monitoring your booking to ensure you have the smoothest journey possible. We can confirm that your booking is in order and your current seat request is </span><span style="color:#e74c3c;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">(1A)</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">.&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/log-in.html?referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qantas.com%2Fau%2Fen%2Ffrequent-flyer%2Fyour-account%2Fbookings.html" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">View my booking</a></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">Before travel, ensure you check the latest <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates.html" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">government travel requirements</a> which may include mandatory health declarations, use of face masks, entry permits, pre-approval and quarantine (possibly at your own expense), or you could be denied entry.&nbsp; We also recommend checking<b>&nbsp;</b></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates/coronavirus/impact-to-lounges.html?int_cam=au%3Acoronavirus%3Aarticle%3Ainflight--airport-and-service-changes%3Aen%3Ann" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">airport, lounge and in-flight services updates</a>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">for the latest information on the Qantas experience.<br />
<br />
We are excited that our London lounge is now open and we look forward to welcoming you to relax in the lounge before your&nbsp;departure.<br />
<br />
Welcome back and thank you for choosing to fly with us.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Kind regards,</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
